WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.680
Go berserk, Selfish!

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:08.690
It's empty here, so what the bike are you stopping me for?

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.050
You're a hazard to anyone walking through here!

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.360
Bike!

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.620
Bike!

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:15.890
Bike!

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.800
What is giving you so much trouble?

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.600
Cure Ace!

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.300
You were here?

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.400
An enemy this weak should give you no problems!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.870
Strict as ever, I see...

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.120
Pedestrians can move it!

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:39.930
You're taking far too long!

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.550
We shall meet again. Adieu.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.190
Huh?!

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:47.330
She ran off...

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.170
Bikeikeikeike!

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:52.350
Girls, we must concentrate!

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:53.100
Yeah!

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:55.940
Love Heart Arrow!

00:00:58.670 --> 00:00:59.700
Mach 1000!

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.530
Huh? Mach 1000?

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.180
That's absurd!

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.680
Sword, aim for its tires!

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:08.550
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.350
You'll have to do better th—

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:22.840
Precure Heart Shoot!

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:32.690
Love love loooooove!

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:43.020
{OP}

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:49.210
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.680
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:54.560
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:56.600
Every day it sparkles

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.280
Dokidoki Precure

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:07.180
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:12.860
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:02:13.010 --> 00:02:18.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:23.920
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:29.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:38.500
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.170
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:42.570
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:45.400
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:48.210
What's more than just cute

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:52.080
is our promise between girls

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:58.120
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:04.020
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:15.970
It's Out of the Bag?!

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:15.970
It's Out of the Bag?!

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:20.750
I do think she's a bit hard on us,

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:24.440
but it's thanks to Cure Ace that we became stronger.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:27.360
Though we still don't know anything about her.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:30.550
She seems to come and go like the wind.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:31.330
Yeah.

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:34.800
Oh, that's where my mom takes her tea classes.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:37.270
It's Madoka Mari's house.

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:39.740
Madoka?

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:44.310
So you had to deliver some snacks?

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:44.940
Yeah.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:47.280
My dad made them himself!

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:49.410
They're for tomorrow's tea ceremony.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:50.550
Tea ceremony?

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:54.190
It's an outdoor tea party where you serve guests.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.340
Coming!

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:02.740
Oh?

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:03.470
Cure A—

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.660
Madoka!

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.420
... Aguri is my name.

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:07.680
Oh, Mana.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.330
You must be delivering the snacks.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:12.030
Um, yes...

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:14.430
Thank you.

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:18.150
These will make tomorrow's ceremony a fine one.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.690
You're familiar with my granddaughter?

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.010
Huh? Granddaughter?!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:23.560
Cure A—

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:24.380
The other day!

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:26.830
I met them at the festival.

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:29.080
Oh, I see.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.280
Could I have a minute?

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:32.290
Uh...

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:40.970
When my grandmother is around,

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:42.870
please don't call me "Cure Ace"!

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:44.680
So you really are Cure A—

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:47.680
I never thought you lived so nearby.

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.640
It's like you were hiding right under our noses!

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.840
I'd prefer it if you didn't put it that way.

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:55.590
I never ran or hid.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:58.310
That said, right now...

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.780
is a bit inconvenient.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:04.250
Oh, I have an idea!

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:14.960
Dangit, they make my stomach turn!

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:21.240
If you keep that up, we won't have a hideout left.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.440
How can I <i>not</i> stuff myself?

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:29.670
True, the Precure's sudden boost in power was most unexpected...

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:33.920
If we do nothing, we very well may repeat the failures of Bel's team.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.450
Perhaps we should try the combination technique, too.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.460
What, you and me?

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:45.600
Your wild side really appeals to me.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:48.810
Wild?

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:50.710
That's got a nice ring to it.

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:53.770
And that top hat of yours ain't bad.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:56.580
Oh, how nice. Now then...

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.740
Let's give it a try!

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:06.120
I'm pleased you could make it.

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:07.400
Hello!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:10.590
You have our thanks for inviting us.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:13.110
I'm kind of nervous about the ceremony,

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:15.630
but this is a great chance to learn more about Cure Ace!

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:16.290
You're right.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.080
Please, follow me.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:26.610
Now, I shall begin instructing you in the Way of Tea.

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:29.000
Well, we don't want to go tha—

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.670
The Precure's Five Vows!

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:31.640
Listen! {She's holding up her finger god dammit Toei it's like you're actively trying to make my mistranslations look accurate}

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:36.280
m 260 39 l 752 40 l 740 537 l 370 553 l 362 673 l 259 673

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:36.280
A Precure

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.280
A Precure must be a first class lady! {TS}

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.280
must be a

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.280
first class

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:36.280
lady.

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:37.880
Really?

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.850
Before I serve you tea, you must eat your snacks.

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:43.150
S-Sure!

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.730
It's yummy!

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:58.700
Want it?

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:05.600
A tea ceremony is for serving others.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.850
A server would never eat her guest's food!

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:12.280
She acts pretty cute whenever sweets are involved...

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.050
Yeah.

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:30.190
Where are your manners?

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:30.720
Oh!

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:33.470
Uh, rub a dub dub?

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:34.920
No, Mana.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:38.440
"I humbly accept your service" is the phrase.

00:07:39.760 --> 00:07:42.220
The Yotsuba family knows their etiquette!

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:47.460
Um, I think there's something you need to do before drinking...

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:51.660
Good thing I studied for this exact situation!

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.490
Take the teacup, and...

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.500
turn it! {You're apparently supposed to turn the teacup before drinking from it because when the server presents it to you, they present the most beautiful part of the cup, and you don't want to get your mouth slobbering over that part like a neanderthal.}

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:00.580
That's not the kind of turning they meant!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.540
Huh?

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:03.060
These are big!

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:04.360
I can't drink!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:07.670
A-A little more...

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.460
Oh dear.

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:19.130
I suppose Ai is a bit young for tea.

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:20.480
Girls!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.670
Sorry! We'll be serious now!

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:29.820
My legs fell asleep...

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:31.990
Makopi, are yours all right?

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.480
Of course!

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:39.550
Slee...

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:40.960
They fell asleep!

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:42.300
She was faking it.

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:49.940
Um, Aguri?

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:53.380
Well, you were all just so silly!

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.680
I'll end the ceremony here for today.

00:08:57.190 --> 00:09:02.160
By the way, outdoor ceremonies don't require all the formalities of indoor ones.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:06.860
You strung us along?

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:09.390
I did no such thing.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:12.980
Geez!

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:19.610
You seem to be enjoying yourselves.

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:20.480
Grandmother!

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:26.150
This is the first time you've invited friends for a tea ceremony, no?

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:30.850
Please, be good friends with Aguri.

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:32.040
Sure!

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:34.210
Please, Grandmother!

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.840
I'll go take a stroll with my friends.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:40.030
Toll!

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:42.230
Have fun, then.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.860
It's so pretty!

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:51.840
This river's water is famously clear.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:56.280
It feels great.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.510
It does!

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:02.720
This is so nice!

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:10.610
When Aguri isn't Cure Ace,

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:12.760
she's actually a normal girl.

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:20.360
I'd like to apologize for being so hard on you all until now.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.330
I just wanted you all to grow stronger.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.970
You must have much you want to ask me, no?

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:31.310
I'll answer anything.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:34.340
Why did you make us stronger?

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:38.020
You could probably take on King Selfish alone!

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.990
I couldn't possibly do it alone.

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:03.950
I am a Precure born in this world.

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:07.920
I once lost in a battle against the Selfish.

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:10.850
After that,

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:14.190
my partner, Ai, returned to being an egg,

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:16.190
and we had been separated ever since.

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:21.460
But one day, Ai suddenly returned to me,

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:24.440
and led me to you girls.

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:28.850
That must have happened while she was supposed to be with Joe.

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.890
I have a question, too.

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:32.910
Go ahead.

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:36.250
Why do you get bigger when you transform?

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.760
That's the power of my feelings.

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:38.710
Power of your feelings?

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:44.090
I want nothing more than to protect worlds that are terrorized by the Selfish!

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:47.790
Those feelings allow me to grow up.

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.420
That's amazing!

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:53.940
As we speak, many worlds are being engulfed by King Selfish,

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.630
bringing him ever closer to resurrection.

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.850
To stand against him,

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:02.570
I need you to rise to the Precure's true stage and fight by my side!

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:06.130
We understand.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:07.780
Now that we've grown strong—

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:08.970
There's still a long way to go!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.450
You must become even stronger!

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:15.080
There is no choice!

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:18.050
The terror of the Selfishes is no trifling matter!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:22.230
My grandmother knows nothing of what we've discussed.

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:25.000
So I beg of you, keep it a secret from her!

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:27.540
I don't want to put her in danger.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.520
Of course. Right?

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:31.460
We promise.

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:33.770
<i>We have to try harder.</i>

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.170
<i>Regina needs us, too... {Oh hey, Toei didn't forget about her. Cool.}</i>

