00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:51.010
It's two times as big, five times as strong, making it ten times the Selfish! {His math is sound.}

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:53.810
It's truly nothing like what we've fought before.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:56.340
