00:14:57.470 --> 00:14:58.420
Ai.

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:02.280
Precure Dress Up!

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:04.560
Kyupirappa!

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.210
Love's trump card,

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:53.120
Cure Ace!

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:57.710
