is all yours!

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.780
Let's BBQ!

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:12.140
Fire!

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:19.660
It's hot!

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:22.430
Gotta grill that meat!

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:24.830
M-Meat?

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:26.400
That's not meat!

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:27.000
It's a meatsile!

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:32.820
Gotta cook those veggies!

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:43.270
Got room for seconds?

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:45.450
There's no stopping him!

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:48.660
<i>I must end it in three minutes...</i>

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:50.360
Combine your attacks!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:52.330
I will pin him down!

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:07.530
Beautify!

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:09.740
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.990
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:20.710
Ace Shot!

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:21.890
Bang!

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:30.090
Turn up the heat!

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.140
Oh no!

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.070
He broke her Ace Shot?

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:38.340
Should you not worry about yourselves?

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:43.580
This is for yesterday!

00:17:45.010 --> 00:17:45.910
Girls!

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:49.050
<i>Two minutes left!</i>

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.020
How about we finish with dessert?

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:54.890
Dessert?

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:58.210
Ooh, I smell something sweet and tasty!

00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:00.930
Let's go, Selfish!

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.700
Where are you going?!

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:06.810
This was supposed to be a team effort!

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:09.380
That way leads to... Grandmother!

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.270
We have to chase it!

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:18.210
<i>Only one minute!</i>

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:21.380
Here it is!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.600
I smell sweets!

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:25.830
Selfish.

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:34.360
What have we here?

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:36.960
Yummy!

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:38.640
Who are you?!

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:41.440
And have you no shame for wearing shoes to a tea ceremony?

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:42.440
Huh?

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:44.570
Want me to eat you, too?

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:48.780
You shall not!

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:50.280
Grandmother!

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:53.270
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.520
Ace Shot!

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:57.480
Oh no, time's up!

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:06.060
Grandmother!

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:10.100
Grandmother!

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:12.430
Stop right there!

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:15.040
Girls!

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:17.440
Why aren't you transformed?

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:23.250
I can only stay in my adult transformation for five minutes!

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.380
That's why you've always left early until now!

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:29.100
Don't worry!

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:32.390
We'll protect the people you hold dear!

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:35.710
Selfish!

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:37.660
Grill 'em well done!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.930
Let's BBQ!

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:46.240
Now's the time to show what the strength Aguri... no, Cure Ace gave me can really do!

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:48.600
Fire!

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:56.540
For our hearts that support each other!

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:06.220
For the feelings we hold dear!

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.060
For our hopes for the future!

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:17.040
Have another helping!

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:20.100
What?

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:24.640
Seeelf!

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:27.710
For the strength that lets us rise when we're fallen!

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:30.660
Love Heart Arrow!

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:41.760
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:59.240
Love love looooove!

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:10.540
This is all because of your gluttony!

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.450
Shut it! I live to eat!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:21.000
I'm fine, really. {There's a "You're not injured, are you?" before this, but it's too hard to hear.}

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.230
Thanks to those mysterious girls, anyway.

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:26.780
I failed rather spectacularly today, huh?

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:28.440
Not at all!

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:31.170
Aguri, you were great.

00:21:33.840 --> 00:21:35.570
Here, this one's for you.

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:37.910
You didn't eat it? {More importantly, that was in your kimono the whole time?}

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:42.850
Thank you so much for today!

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:44.320
No, thank you!

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:47.720
I look forward to your continued guidance.

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:51.190
Then from now on, I'll be even stricter!

00:21:51.190 --> 00:21:52.660
Huh?!

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:04.230
{ED}

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:07.990
It's summer!

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:09.090
Festival time!

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:10.560
Yukatas and fireworks!

00:22:10.560 --> 00:22:11.410
No!

00:22:11.410 --> 00:22:13.220
You have no time for playing around!

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.390
You have to focus on training!

00:22:15.990 --> 00:22:16.860
But can't we ju—

00:22:16.860 --> 00:22:17.620
No means no!

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:21.740
But there's a stall selling Super Special Scrumptious Sweets...

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:22.810
What a shame.

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:23.320
Huh?

00:22:23.320 --> 00:22:25.880
Super Special Scrumptious Sweets?!

00:22:27.090 --> 00:22:28.600
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:31.730
Heart Pounding!

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:31.730
Heart Pounding!

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:33.730
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
